{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game is not complete. Mechanics are missing, so if you like it and want to see what it can offer, don't hesitate to add it to your wishlist. </strong><strong><br> <br>Ravengrave 1: Iron Bonds</strong> is a pixel art game focused on blacksmithing, controlled entirely with the mouse. Take on the role of a young viking who must master the craft to repay a massive debt.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forge with precision:</strong> Purchase materials, melt them down, and mold them to craft items using an interactive blacksmithing system.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Management and trade:</strong> Run your smithy, balance costs, upgrade your equipment, and meet customer demands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep narrative:</strong> Uncover the story behind your father's debt while tending to the village\u2019s needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic survival:</strong> Choose between completing main quests, handling side commissions, or mass-selling to keep your business afloat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With detailed pixel art and gameplay that is both accessible and challenging, <i><strong>Ravengrave 1: Iron Bonds</strong></i> offers an immersive experience of forging and survival. Will you forge your own destiny, or will the weight of debt crush you?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513720?t=1745271146","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745271146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513720/fabcaee9999f47b10415c70b9e96e965c272f85e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745271146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513720/fabcaee9999f47b10415c70b9e96e965c272f85e/capsule_184x69.jpg